WEBVTT

00:04:27.972 --> 00:04:31.017
every Sunday night at eight,
without them knowing.

00:04:32.268 --> 00:04:33.561
(Laughter)

00:04:34.186 --> 00:04:36.731
I wish Homer had worked at a coal plant.

00:04:36.772 --> 00:04:39.025
(Laughter)

00:04:39.358 --> 00:04:40.609
In the last 10 years,

00:04:40.651 --> 00:04:43.821
we have spent trillions
of dollars on renewables,

00:04:43.863 --> 00:04:49.035
yet we only get eight percent
of our electricity from wind and solar.

00:04:49.452 --> 00:04:51.454
Now, don't get me wrong,
I love renewables,

00:04:51.495 --> 00:04:54.749
but to me, it's clear that we need more.

00:04:54.790 --> 00:04:57.710
We need a source of energy that's clean

00:04:57.710 --> 00:05:00.296
and works 24/7 to complement them.